-- Q1597: Audit Evidence [medium/L1]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under AU-C 580.20, the management representation letter should be dated as of the date of the auditor''s report. AU-C 580.A19 explains this ensures representations cover all events and transactions through the date the auditor has obtained sufficient appropriate evidence.
Wrong (A): Dating as of the balance sheet date would leave a gap between year-end and the report date during which events could occur without management''s representations covering them.
Wrong (B): The beginning of fieldwork is too early — many audit procedures and potential subsequent events occur after fieldwork begins.
